msgid "Learn about today’s real-world applications of quantum computing."
msgstr "Pelajari aplikasi komputasi kuantum di dunia nyata saat ini."

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
